exam: It is given that a motor vehicle travels {s} km in each hour. Determine the distance, in km, covered in {h} hours.
exam: Ascertain the distance travelled by the family of {a} over a period of {h.words} hours at a constant speed of {s} km per hour.
exam: Whereas a train proceeds at a uniform rate of {s} km per hour, state the distance in km traversed during {h} hours.
exam: Compute the product of a speed of {s} km per hour and a duration of {h} hours, expressed as a distance in km.
exercise: After Grandma passed away, {a}'s family drove to the funeral at {s} km an hour for {h} hours. How many km did they drive?
exercise: {a}'s dad was laid off, so now he drives a delivery van. It goes {s} km each hour, {h} hours a day. How many km does he drive in a day?
